Real AI says… Marketing label says… "Deep learning" "Smart", "intelligent" (no detail) "Human and vehicle classification" "Motion detection" or "smart motion detection" with no classification "Line-crossing / intrusion based on human/vehicle" "Line-crossing, intrusion" (could be motion-based) "False alarm filtering (human/vehicle)" "AI" in the product name only "Face recognition, face library of X faces" "Face detection" or "face capture" "ANPR / LPR" with stated conditions "Vehicle detection" <pre><code>flowchart TD
    Q1{"Says deep learning or&lt;br/&gt;human/vehicle classification?"}
    Q1 -- No --&gt; N["Assume NOT real AI&lt;br/&gt;until proven"]
    Q1 -- Yes --&gt; Q2{"Works alone, or only with&lt;br/&gt;a compatible NVR?"}
    Q2 -- Alone --&gt; Y[Real AI camera]
    Q2 -- "NVR only" --&gt; C["Real AI, but only with&lt;br/&gt;that brand's AI NVR"]</code></pre>
